                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "DO NOT BUY THIS!\n\nThis game needs about a year(or more) worth of work. Cool idea, poor execution. Blatent cash grab with the \"The Rake\" attached to it. Kind of funny how this was 15$ on release yesterday (11/15/2016) and now it's already down to 5$ after all the negative reviews(11/17/2016), pathetic. \n\nThe developer should be ashamed of themselves for trying to pass this 5 minute romp in the woods off as some kind of game. I still can't get over the fact that they had the audacity to try to pass this off for 15$. This is the epitome of greed.\n\nYOU'VE BEEN WARNED!",
